<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="ALFVe" id="ALFVe" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uca4ff49a" id="uca4ff49a">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="u0783c8f0" id="u0783c8f0"> 𝐆𝐏𝐓𝐀𝐐: 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐅𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐭𝐮𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠-𝐅𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐀𝐬𝐲𝐦𝐦𝐞𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐜 𝐂𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐛𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ucb76b1e2" id="ucb76b1e2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u85a619e0" id="u85a619e0">当前最先进的量化方法往往依赖模型微调。这些方法通过梯度下降更新参数，而随着模型规模的增长，这一过程变得愈发困难。考虑到量化配置存在多种可能的选择，包括位格式、对称性选择等，这种计算负担尤为突出，降低基于微调的量化方法的效率</span></strong></p><ul list="ue32aaf04"><li fid="ua61997cb" data-lake-id="u6a594215" id="u6a594215"><span data-lake-id="u18ab6698" id="u18ab6698">本文聚焦于免微调量化，即绕过基于梯度的优化，转而通过前向传播进行校准计算。近期文献已提出多种此类方法。其中，GPTQ 在速度与精度之间实现尤为有效的兼顾，因此在机器学习社区得到广泛应用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud2bd98d5" id="ud2bd98d5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u942bc3d8" id="u942bc3d8" style="color: #AD1A2B">GPTQ 中的一个关键问题，将其称为对称校准。对称校准问题源于每一层均以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc16c8282358a6e2b95a68d50b7e16f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iC8Lx%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0c3a6d1" id="uc0c3a6d1" style="color: #AD1A2B">为优化目标，其中输入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fd2ecce63e6b52b6164d90bcce651fe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G29Mk%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u072ccebe" id="u072ccebe" style="color: #AD1A2B">来自前一量化层的输出。该输入与原始模型的输入激活</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe4a3b9f1ad9a2801503b1917e09470e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rmQJf%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u91f4a24f" id="u91f4a24f" style="color: #AD1A2B">存在偏差。作者优化目标引入全精度模型的输入激活，将这一方式称为非对称校准。同时提出 GPTAQ 来解决非对称校准问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u0e5b275a"><li fid="uf3458850" data-lake-id="u877c2425" id="u877c2425"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb8b29df" id="ueb8b29df" style="color: #5C0036">分析非对称校准，并表明，最优的权重更新需要同时考虑量化误差、Hessian 逆矩阵以及输入偏差</span></strong></li><li fid="uf3458850" data-lake-id="u90ac7aec" id="u90ac7aec"><strong><span data-lake-id="u75effbc5" id="u75effbc5" style="color: #5C0036">提出通过若干改进实现非对称校准，包括对所有输出通道进行高效并行处理，以及将残差误差分解到各个通道维度，以提高效率</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub0c62590" id="ub0c62590" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791728862950-b2fa3f36-c552-4703-b2fb-89b95e227c34.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue0ed5c7e-4241-4909-bb59-306db409c05%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u20cbfd88-69e6-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A500%2C%22height%22%3A221%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A54205%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A625%2C%22originHeight%22%3A276%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)ASVMMETRICCALIBRATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A220%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MINWX-WX%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A331%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%E4%B8%80WX%22%2C%22x%22%3A376%2C%22y%22%3A163%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A)SYMMETRICCALHIBRATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A232%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A209%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNGUANTIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A480%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNQUANTIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A481%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CALIBRATING%22%2C%22x%22%3A290%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CALIBRATING%22%2C%22x%22%3A290%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNQUANTIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNGUANTIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A482%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNGUANTIZEO%22%2C%22x%22%3A82%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYER1%22%2C%22x%22%3A147%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYER3%22%2C%22x%22%3A531%2C%22y%22%3A221%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYER2%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A328%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A176%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f5ec%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u19904900%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="TQ0pl" id="TQ0pl" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u2dfe72e6" id="u2dfe72e6">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u28d7603b" id="u28d7603b"> 𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u57328f6f" id="u57328f6f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a5c3c10" id="u9a5c3c10">免微调量化：鉴于预训练大模型的庞大规模，免微调量化因能够直接导出量化后的模型检查点而受到广泛关注</span></strong></p><ul list="ucebd2bef"><li fid="u3a93e898" data-lake-id="ue01c310d" id="ue01c310d"><span data-lake-id="u023e94a1" id="u023e94a1">一类经典的免微调方法是利用偏置和缩放因子校正分布。AWQ、SmoothQuant、Outlier Suppression 和 Outlier Suppression+ 提出缓解语言 Transformer 中离群值问题的方法。其他方法则涉及架构修改，例如通道拆分与合并</span></li><li fid="u3a93e898" data-lake-id="ubf53127c" id="ubf53127c"><span data-lake-id="ud19a0863" id="ud19a0863">近期，QuIP 提出通过非相干化处理，将权重分布转换为更适合量化的形式。QuIP# 采用 Hadamard 变换提高变换效率，QuaRot 进一步引入在线操作，将其扩展至激活变换</span></li><li fid="u3a93e898" data-lake-id="u4dc7c2c4" id="u4dc7c2c4"><span data-lake-id="ud5c08703" id="ud5c08703">异构处理方法，例如 LLM.int8()、BiLLM 和 Slim-LLM，为重要元素分配更多的量化表示空间，即更高的精度，但这需要复杂的硬件设计</span></li><li fid="u3a93e898" data-lake-id="u982cdf09" id="u982cdf09"><span data-lake-id="u90583dc4" id="u90583dc4">作为本文方法的前身，GPTQ（2022）利用闭式解优化权重元素，因此不需要反向传播</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue25f817f" id="ue25f817f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5eba0192" id="u5eba0192">基于微调的量化：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9ecf7856" id="u9ecf7856">基于微调的量化需要执行前向传播和反向传播，因此消耗更多计算资源。全网络微调能够取得良好性能，但其受限于规模较小的模型。局部微调方法可以缓解这一问题（AdaRound；AdaQuant；BRECQ；QDrop；OmniQuant；QuIP#），然而，其所需的时间和资源仍远多于免微调方法</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubffc30bb" id="ubffc30bb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ab675dd" id="u6ab675dd">最优脑外科方法：该方法最初应用于仅包含数百个权重的小型网络。已有研究致力于降低较大模型中 Hessian 矩阵的估计复杂度，例如 Fisher 近似和 K-FAC 近似。作者的方法扩展最优脑压缩（Optimal Brain Compression），后者使用层输入的 Gram 矩阵作为 Hessian 矩阵，执行逐层量化。关键区别在于，作者为真实目标对应的输入引入一个校正项，从而形成非对称校准框架</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u24189994" id="u24189994"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8907f39c" id="u8907f39c" style="color: #663000">将浮点模型参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bm%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c5fecb852c4bd27bc4fe24620af9d3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IlLc5%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucea3c49f" id="ucea3c49f" style="color: #663000">从 FP16 转换为整数表示</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6938b48e4bcab4db5a82b82da7c323a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EGccS%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u28f3f70d" id="u28f3f70d" style="color: #663000">，需要通过校准过程保持模型的行为。最优脑量化（Optimal Brain Quantization，OBQ）框架对这一校准过程进行形式化描述，而 GPTQ 则针对大模型高效地实现该框架。OBQ 校准过程的核心是最小化原始层输出与量化层输出之间的差异</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u40ba3515" id="u40ba3515" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%2B%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%3D%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf3f1e4191a16f84d3b59a645aa146cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qbtZ8%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u64cee0d7"><li fid="ua88cd377" data-lake-id="ue3035c2d" id="ue3035c2d"><span data-lake-id="ube1046a5" id="ube1046a5">借助 OBS 框架（Hassibi et al., 1993），OBQ 以迭代方式求解这一优化问题。对于每个权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QwfS8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uadb9f390" id="uadb9f390">，它计算最优量化值及相应的调整量</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua8f5317b" id="ua8f5317b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%3D%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_q%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q-w_q)%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bqq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q-w_q%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bqq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9856e2e93312d3745d630237b5bb0dcf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TRl5f%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ube0f145e"><li fid="ue3ab7351" data-lake-id="u419fe359" id="u419fe359"><span data-lake-id="ucdb7ec7d" id="ucdb7ec7d">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcde21507f43a13000754ba9d6d0e57f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LYzHb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8e07e72a" id="u8e07e72a"> 表示 Hessian 逆矩阵。每量化一个权重后，便利用高斯消元高效更新 Hessian 逆矩阵，以排除已量化的元素</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u61be5148" id="u61be5148" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-q%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bqq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Cqquad%20(3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fafc05e5dd112d53208f02c0ef0515060.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KkYAS%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua4e45e89"><li fid="ud96344e2" data-lake-id="u89e82da0" id="u89e82da0"><span data-lake-id="uef8685a1" id="uef8685a1">尽管 OBQ 提供闭式解，但对于拥有数十亿参数的 Transformer 模型，其计算成本高得难以承受。GPTQ 通过增强并行化，并借助 Cholesky 重构提高数值稳定性，克服这一局限，使该方法能够实用且稳健地应用于拥有数千亿参数的模型</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="PJlTX" id="PJlTX" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u26dea460" id="u26dea460">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="ua1238ad7" id="ua1238ad7"> 𝐆𝐏𝐓𝐀𝐐 𝐌𝐞𝐭𝐡𝐨𝐝𝐨𝐥𝐨𝐠𝐲</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0489a706" id="u0489a706"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd7915e0" id="ucd7915e0" style="color: #DF2A3F">作者认为，GPTQ 和原始 OBQ 的一个关键局限在于对输入激活采取对称处理，未能考虑量化层如何逐步改变激活模式。随着量化推进至更深的网络层，这一问题变得尤为突出。因此，引入非对称校准框架，旨在保留浮点模型中各层输入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe4a3b9f1ad9a2801503b1917e09470e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SuQxA%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d7405a4" id="u3d7405a4" style="color: #DF2A3F">的特征。优化目标变为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4d0d65e2" id="u4d0d65e2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%2B%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%3D%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(4)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe18d32063c0d7df5867d404c3c1d5b24.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K5sdN%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud85d4973"><li fid="u26a4bee8" data-lake-id="u191eae21" id="u191eae21"><span data-lake-id="u766c6b04" id="u766c6b04">在实际应用中，差异</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23343a426247457ca76f05177d6066a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kxsBG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufd06e8c5" id="ufd06e8c5">既可能来自前面各层的激活量化，也可能来自权重量化。这种偏差随着网络深度的增加而系统性地累积</span></li><li fid="u26a4bee8" data-lake-id="u43a0ace3" id="u43a0ace3"><span data-lake-id="uf1f8d924" id="uf1f8d924">在 GPTQ 量化过程中，激活的平均绝对误差（MAE）损失随 Transformer 块的加深而持续增大，揭示对称校准中的根本性偏差。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23cdd626" id="u23cdd626" style="color: #5C0036">本文提出两项主要贡献：首先，建立一个能够最优处理非对称校准的严格理论框架；其次，提出一种高效的 GPU 实现策略，将这些认识落实为 GPTAQ 框架</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u332e4c29" id="u332e4c29"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0844b59a" id="u0844b59a">针对非对称校准问题推导求解方法。首先考虑单个输出通道，即一行权重的优化。引入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48463facf2e6bdd4218e7c2352e13a54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FlUVN%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub06a9d1d" id="ub06a9d1d">表示输出激活残差</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d598daa8ccae1c5fa70366376055246.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22izoIm%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubade504c" id="ubade504c">，从而将目标改写为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u27e6b61d" id="u27e6b61d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%3D%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(5)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf2ab817385a24e60be91fb90e9b7ce3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WBU3r%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u200eee3c" id="u200eee3c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0dab27b9" id="u0dab27b9">优化策略通过以下步骤迭代进行：选择一个权重 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81840ac2ba44c10bc9581fb112e5747d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LRTXe%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e109b8d" id="u7e109b8d"> 进行量化；计算最优权重更新量 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8260d0bc309eeefb29e610a4e6c51d49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Uvb4D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b706020" id="u2b706020">，以最小化损失函数</span></strong></p><ul list="u337a67d6"><li fid="uebe0afe2" data-lake-id="uef7d2b4e" id="uef7d2b4e"><span data-lake-id="u9ed4cec3" id="u9ed4cec3">对于第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bErGY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9897b80a" id="u9897b80a"> 个权重的量化，引入约束 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_q%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2Bw_q-%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0050fab228980fd6deb4261dd796987d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pszij%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e13d596" id="u7e13d596">，其中 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d62e2d5a78bb1240794acb74bbfe47c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22suJQG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6477eebb" id="u6477eebb"> 表示第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iDR8p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u66c3d23b" id="u66c3d23b"> 个位置为 1、其余元素均为 0 的单位向量。由此得到一个嵌套优化问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc1fb8a30" id="uc1fb8a30" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_q%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_q%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2Bw_q-%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q%3D0%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(6)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff6c47572005c32a15773dab6b5624c6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aN4Ay%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4b221d5e"><li fid="ub73e0cc0" data-lake-id="u64161aa9" id="u64161aa9"><span data-lake-id="ub2eba54d" id="ub2eba54d">为求解这一约束优化问题，构造其拉格朗日函数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7640e4c4" id="u7640e4c4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%3D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2%2B%5C%5Clambda%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_q%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2Bw_q-%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Cqquad%20(7)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F033ff23f552f122982ad7ca017092543.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O9Ynq%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u97081279"><li fid="u84af9fa3" data-lake-id="u412bd542" id="u412bd542"><span data-lake-id="u474b1d61" id="u474b1d61">对拉格朗日函数求导</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uafb20a83" id="uafb20a83" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%3D2%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D-2%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2B%5C%5Clambda%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_q%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20L%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Clambda%7D%3D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_q%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2Bw_q-%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20(8)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F74139d8f6ea88865f6b28f594cf44bb8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wAUu2%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u12442ee6"><li fid="u5c060aa4" data-lake-id="u2442a3bd" id="u2442a3bd"><span data-lake-id="u68245837" id="u68245837">将上述导数设为零，即可得到最优权重更新量 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8260d0bc309eeefb29e610a4e6c51d49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tQ97U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u271da37e" id="u271da37e">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u93404fdc" id="u93404fdc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q-w_q%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bqq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(9)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fac7a5a06f605bdebf001de3e99ade5fe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DTLpc%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u791b7f8b"><li fid="u9b78a9b4" data-lake-id="uf61516a2" id="uf61516a2"><span data-lake-id="u71d05115" id="u71d05115">相应的损失函数为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u851c2ce9" id="u851c2ce9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_q%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q-w_q)%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bqq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D-2%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q-w_q%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bqq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(10)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd9191bc8b40d4345c6136e7eebf5ae9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mgaFV%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5c0cdd97"><li fid="ufee7b0b2" data-lake-id="uc66b5338" id="uc66b5338"><span data-lake-id="ub84ad2db" id="ub84ad2db">其中，根据式（3），</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e3bdf8813e921765aad023ef40583ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zK8J1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u367302ca" id="u367302ca"> 表示通过高斯消元将第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ehFEx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u371061db" id="u371061db"> 行和第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZUrEu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb26ae28" id="ubb26ae28"> 列置零后得到的 Hessian 逆矩阵</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u01374a3c" id="u01374a3c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u582d08c5" id="u582d08c5">该最优框架以迭代方式运行：首先计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%3D%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_q%20L_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F196f046819046625eacc0091a4a89b83.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S9bKK%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u66196d9c" id="u66196d9c">，随后将第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NzzjS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf95b118" id="ubf95b118">个权重量化为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bw%7D_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc4ed10e3b3fe767c5c1c42fec68f17ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BXRsA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua70c95d2" id="ua70c95d2">，最后利用</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8260d0bc309eeefb29e610a4e6c51d49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G4UfA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u711139ff" id="u711139ff">更新其余全精度权重。重复这一过程，直至所有权重元素均完成量化</span></strong></p><ul list="u1060cb5b"><li fid="u7f464eb4" data-lake-id="u4a75b846" id="u4a75b846"><span data-lake-id="u4bce2ee2" id="u4bce2ee2">然而，将这一直接实现应用于大型 Transformer 模型时，会面临显著的效率挑战。这不仅源于计算每个权重对应的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92f16a7f1fbdc9cb4103716794c3128f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mq9IN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua8e09612" id="ua8e09612"> 所需的开销，还因为不同输出通道具有不同的最优 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rTals%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29414bf4" id="u29414bf4"> 顺序，从而阻碍有效的 GPU 并行化</span></li><li fid="u7f464eb4" data-lake-id="ua178b860" id="ua178b860"><span data-lake-id="u27e3ca96" id="u27e3ca96">由于每个权重的处理都涉及多次 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%5C%5Ctimes%20n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29e2ed2b656b1c0aa45c95c88aa79075.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pwZks%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d30aff8" id="u5d30aff8"> 矩阵乘法，计算负担尤为严重，对于大型基础模型而言，其成本高得难以承受。此外，每次权重更新都需要重新估计输出残差 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Br%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48463facf2e6bdd4218e7c2352e13a54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ad6PC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd84a295" id="ucd84a295">。为克服这些局限，提出四个优化步骤，使其效率能够与 GPTQ 相当</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="u5q3d" id="u5q3d" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ud7768341" id="ud7768341">🚀 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐒𝐨𝐥𝐮𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ufe6b43ec" id="ufe6b43ec"><strong><span data-lake-id="u67557a3a" id="u67557a3a">步骤 1：以任意顺序处理 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zdmc3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d89b72b" id="u8d89b72b">。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u74ea4aff" id="u74ea4aff"> 大规模基础模型庞大的参数空间启发一项重要优化：可以按照任意顺序处理权重，而不必严格遵循由 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92f16a7f1fbdc9cb4103716794c3128f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uHL83%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb805333" id="ubb805333"> 确定的最优顺序。在量化单个权重元素时，广阔的权重空间提供足够的灵活性来补偿量化误差。GPTQ 的实证结果支持这一认识：与任意顺序相比，遵循 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92f16a7f1fbdc9cb4103716794c3128f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fBlIo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e12ad78" id="u9e12ad78"> 的最优降序排列仅能带来有限的改进</span></p><ul list="u8f617ac4"><li fid="ub31046ff" data-lake-id="ua78c89eb" id="ua78c89eb"><span data-lake-id="u2ddc047a" id="u2ddc047a">以任意顺序处理权重还具有一项实际优势：它允许并行处理所有行，从而高效利用 GPU 的计算能力。因此，采用 GPTQ 的列处理顺序，即从第一列到最后一列依次处理。对于每个 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%3D1%2C2%2C3%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1faf396ded272d60c2c2c94e7cc7fdd1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E6aAY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a834b6d" id="u8a834b6d">，通过下式同时计算所有行的权重更新量 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd7a157a0d5400b80e5ccca2046a8c6ff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YaknP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28705d48" id="u28705d48">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1ea75f74" id="u1ea75f74" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bqq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(11)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ec79f2ec1abb1212b869df0f4acf55e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pmI3p%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua1e0c729"><li fid="u3abe7be8" data-lake-id="u71587a7e" id="u71587a7e"><span data-lake-id="u93e46c00" id="u93e46c00">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd779ee277938dcbb0274c7d233f2900d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fuGn2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua4cd68ac" id="ua4cd68ac"> 表示所有行，即所有输出通道的输出残差。采用这一形式，只需维护一份 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e3bdf8813e921765aad023ef40583ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CWx5z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0336b04e" id="u0336b04e">，因为对于给定的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mm12k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d3fd333" id="u1d3fd333">，它在所有行之间保持不变</span></li><li fid="u3abe7be8" data-lake-id="u7d2e04c5" id="u7d2e04c5"><span data-lake-id="u6b16ec7f" id="u6b16ec7f">尽管这一方法实现行之间的并行处理，但仍存在两项显著的计算挑战：每次迭代都需要估计新的残差 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1227f701376733061841f20c2cacfce0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jV21O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8623ea72" id="u8623ea72">，以及矩阵乘法 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4acc72d5cec51d58fe396d2179a1f03c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l2oFF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1136ea31" id="u1136ea31"> 带来的计算负担。要使该方法在大规模模型上达到实际可用的效率，必须解决这些问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue0414996" id="ue0414996"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf75a0818" id="uf75a0818">步骤 2：高效的残差分解。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9d188c20" id="u9d188c20"> 算法中的另一项关键效率问题是残差 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1227f701376733061841f20c2cacfce0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SOTju%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubdf296ff" id="ubdf296ff"> 的重复计算。尽管 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4acc72d5cec51d58fe396d2179a1f03c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OIYE9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u08357d68" id="u08357d68"> 能够有效缩小量化模型与全精度模型输出之间的差距，但每次新的迭代都需要重新估计输出残差 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1227f701376733061841f20c2cacfce0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FJB0z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u272698a3" id="u272698a3">。将输入激活的残差记为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa2f0eb344a2bfefd411befb9fbf118c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DDy5Z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u960d3346" id="u960d3346">，其更新公式为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5dcd6fa8" id="u5dcd6fa8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_%7B-q%7D-%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-q%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(12)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6ec9bcba35d05aa776abe55b20dc9612.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OGPJA%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ubbbe7a59"><li fid="u3876b95a" data-lake-id="u1c9d1367" id="u1c9d1367"><span data-lake-id="u1403db8e" id="u1403db8e">这一操作会产生较大的计算开销，其复杂度为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(mnk)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F69f362fc5396dd9e4c97563056b4c76a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xy9DI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5543cb1b" id="u5543cb1b">，其中 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ENx1o%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29008b85" id="u29008b85"> 为 token 长度与校准样本数量的乘积。对 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cz9Dx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5cec13f5" id="u5cec13f5"> 的依赖给大型基础模型带来特殊挑战，因为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mnJNc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u398605c7" id="u398605c7"> 通常是 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SxBID%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u949c93f4" id="u949c93f4"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sf9Sc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0bbf54c0" id="u0bbf54c0"> 的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%2210%5C%5Csim50%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab9a3fc025c48d1b874a4fad4e8974ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TwTPQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d54870d" id="u7d54870d"> 倍。提出一种替代方法，以避免重新计算输出残差 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1227f701376733061841f20c2cacfce0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RDGqT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40000b78" id="u40000b78">。关键认识在于，残差可以分解为来自不同神经元的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NJ59B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1dff3e13" id="u1dff3e13"> 个独立分量：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u02f6ded9" id="u02f6ded9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bq%3D1%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(13)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F63198c1fe81a01cc0db9dd3d7144e8f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tQegL%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u6fd59a05"><li fid="ua8626053" data-lake-id="ua59587a4" id="ua59587a4"><span data-lake-id="uf52781e2" id="uf52781e2">通过这一分解，只需在层校准之前估计一次 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1227f701376733061841f20c2cacfce0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hr4Qm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac82d4d3" id="uac82d4d3">。因此，在第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dy3iv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0b3b78e" id="ue0b3b78e"> 次迭代中，前 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84f8b984e99d3fc3b194af05170d9035.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bkgqs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7b408e7c" id="u7b408e7c"> 列已经完成量化，专注于量化第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LGJuZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e49d61e" id="u1e49d61e"> 列，同时最小化与其对应的残差分量：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9c2d494e" id="u9c2d494e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%3A%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bq%3A%2C%3A%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_q%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D-%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(14)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcda23afe811e9d4a27c67b513a159fe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r5z51%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc5e8629b"><li fid="ua5877d08" data-lake-id="ub8ba023c" id="ub8ba023c"><span data-lake-id="u81835a1c" id="u81835a1c">类似地，第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vfVpC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7ab53a5" id="ua7ab53a5"> 次迭代的最优权重更新量变为：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua39461d0" id="ua39461d0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%3A%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%7D_%7Bqq%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(15)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3273df98616781c2fdd0dbec390f39ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zTu3N%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uae581f9c"><li fid="ua9bbc76e" data-lake-id="uf171da31" id="uf171da31"><span data-lake-id="ud8e10631" id="ud8e10631">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-(q-1)%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa0ab652220fd83dd3ea4ea9e391c9c6a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22inrxf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u111d8fb6" id="u111d8fb6"> 表示经过 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F84f8b984e99d3fc3b194af05170d9035.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cSycl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u502ddc8f" id="u502ddc8f"> 次迭代消元后的 Hessian 逆矩阵，因此 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%7D_%7B-q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4af3c180572dc0694b94c1867e98e402.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bz1uD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u535d8e8a" id="u535d8e8a">。值得注意的是，式（15）的第一项与 GPTQ 相同，而第二项用于最小化第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AEIMm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7ff174ad" id="u7ff174ad"> 个神经元的残差误差。由于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F345ced7bd6a5f37edf24d2c294a09ffc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NdrYa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u224945d2" id="u224945d2"> 已经通过先前的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd7a157a0d5400b80e5ccca2046a8c6ff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dIpZp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04a44de5" id="u04a44de5"> 得到更新，因此无需重新估计残差误差。图 3 给出 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%3D2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5536e9e35de5e807e5f383ced7482625.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22twrjN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaea38985" id="uaea38985"> 时第二项的示例</span></li><li fid="ua9bbc76e" data-lake-id="u89585d65" id="u89585d65"><span data-lake-id="udb61c878" id="udb61c878">此外，残差分解还带来显著的计算优势，使第二项的计算复杂度降至原来的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%2Fn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7389e1942e04081095275798166118aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dysZ3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u06a00f47" id="u06a00f47">。这是因为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes(n-q)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a539dd81475869d2d405c5845d31121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sz2lN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3b912fc" id="uf3b912fc"> 是一个行向量，而 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F345ced7bd6a5f37edf24d2c294a09ffc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jBh5v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d51c0c4" id="u3d51c0c4"> 是一个列向量，因此计算第二项仅需 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(mn)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdecddf02b5f13f1783e1aeb874ec5e5f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bExeI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucecc8d94" id="ucecc8d94"> 的复杂度。进一步注意到，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce61cb71612943e55137c4d7b23e8108.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PHjPl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb94634f" id="ubb94634f"> 与权重更新无关，因此可以预先计算每一行并存储在矩阵 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bJ9Wp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2ed15b56" id="u2ed15b56"> 中。这样，在第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U9yXE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud78f0611" id="ud78f0611"> 次迭代中，就可以通过 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9e67cb359f988a3aed51debf89b9928.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WKRHs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u603bfeb9" id="u603bfeb9"> 高效计算第二项</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua437ee2f" id="ua437ee2f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u73a7fadf" id="u73a7fadf">步骤 3：Cholesky 重构。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue510fe50" id="ue510fe50"> 最后一项挑战是在保持数值稳定性的同时高效计算 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q6eoE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8af2fc3d" id="u8af2fc3d">。这些要求源于需要对 Hessian 逆矩阵执行 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s9CYh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33266083" id="u33266083"> 次高斯消元，并进行矩阵乘法计算。随着模型规模的增大，重复的高斯消元操作会累积数值误差。通过对 Hessian 逆矩阵进行 Cholesky 分解来解决这一数值不稳定问题：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd2a9bec925e854d147161bdbd1ded80.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HWfsH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc79485aa" id="uc79485aa">，其中 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70f59d200803e61aaf24c5e731ebd833.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cq24z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7ffcc1d8" id="u7ffcc1d8"> 为下三角 Cholesky 因子。借助以下引理，可以高效且稳定地计算 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c1eb85ccb9cbfd5ef62d5dcc4905873.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L8wJZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u557eac83" id="u557eac83">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u66a0138a" id="u66a0138a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3a9ac56" id="ua3a9ac56">引理 4.1。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u68d8a566" id="u68d8a566"> 给定完整 Hessian 逆矩阵 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5ff65adef91669ca6671a90becbbc6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OOqjd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44a19170" id="u44a19170"> 的 Cholesky 因子 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70f59d200803e61aaf24c5e731ebd833.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BqC01%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8415c37a" id="u8415c37a">，Hessian 逆矩阵 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde3940017a8bdc0ff2493debf3846450.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QgEAF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2afb1291" id="u2afb1291"> 等价于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcb498c235d887a3b917ab970c3438b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mrxHt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaab93084" id="uaab93084">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u934fa1c6" id="u934fa1c6"><span data-lake-id="u6724e659" id="u6724e659">证明见附录 A.2。与高斯消元相比，这一形式具有更好的数值稳定性，仅需矩阵切片和乘法即可得到 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c1eb85ccb9cbfd5ef62d5dcc4905873.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22byuSU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u358dc02e" id="u358dc02e">。因此，可以将 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce8eca81c09af223a3c84be80a7dbcfc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ET9uN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb16ad3e" id="ucb16ad3e"> 改写为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0a93a085" id="u0a93a085" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%3D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(16)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0b69bd96c6381c8708c266f886d0346f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v9gFh%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udc3595a1" id="udc3595a1"><span data-lake-id="u2c19dc5a" id="u2c19dc5a">这里使用 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c0b4dd8daf0ec305afd041aaad05f19.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gaJ0D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c84c883" id="u4c84c883">，是因为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B-q%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1644d7f4d27476c3b7ce6db33c44868d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tikxs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u87437de1" id="u87437de1">。为优化 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HwsoD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3b58ad5" id="uf3b58ad5"> 的计算，首先计算完整矩阵 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcd4c99d0c120202290f79d6db5bd73f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gzlA7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u59880fc1" id="u59880fc1">。此时，关键挑战转变为如何高效利用 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcb498c235d887a3b917ab970c3438b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lHm1z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a0f3b22" id="u8a0f3b22"> 的结构，从而在 GPU 上并行处理 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jw4qq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub5809efe" id="ub5809efe"> 的每一行。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7Bq%2B1%3A%2Cq%2B1%3A%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23173184232736c6fb9782145522fab5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pZOTL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23409bea" id="u23409bea"> 的下三角结构为通过向量化优化计算提供机会，以下定理对此进行形式化描述。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud5cde9e4" id="ud5cde9e4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5adfd402" id="u5adfd402">定理 4.2。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u762f80a6" id="u762f80a6"> 矩阵 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IIbKy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub14079d0" id="ub14079d0"> 等于：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7a585088" id="u7a585088" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%3D%5C%5Cleft((%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D)%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_U%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(17)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e5c03d7f569f124d6caf4aebe7fce75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zpfVX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub13fa5c3" id="ub13fa5c3"><span data-lake-id="ua8294a4b" id="ua8294a4b">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_U%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C1%5C%5C%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5baa486c0da964bbae05f71a842ef056.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NM9AM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u11ceb94d" id="u11ceb94d"> 是一个严格上三角掩码矩阵，对角线上方的元素为 1；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Codot%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd767e0a5df29684a9664622063e8b5e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wZMMD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u55ec1767" id="u55ec1767"> 表示逐元素乘法。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u96121e14" id="u96121e14"><span data-lake-id="u8b37cd8c" id="u8b37cd8c">证明见附录 A.3。借助上述公式，仅需一行代码即可计算 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22retDi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u218aa3a3" id="u218aa3a3">，如图 3 底部所示。此外，所提出的方法能够与 GPTQ 的现有实现无缝集成，因为 GPTQ 同样利用 Cholesky 因子 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70f59d200803e61aaf24c5e731ebd833.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S5yER%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0326a6b5" id="u0326a6b5"> 计算对角元素和第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tDuyn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b3606a7" id="u8b3606a7"> 行向量 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbaa921f8a51d5bcef459bb9d0e7178.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CFijd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc17c7117" id="uc17c7117">。的实现只需对原始 GPTQ 框架进行极少修改。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u290ad402" id="u290ad402"><strong><span data-lake-id="u87582324" id="u87582324">步骤 4：延迟批量更新。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8e5d3d46" id="u8e5d3d46"> 预先计算矩阵 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HOREn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua65151d1" id="ua65151d1"> 后，可以轻松获得第二项。此外，与 GPTQ 一样，第 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rUzxb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71805eec" id="u71805eec"> 列的量化结果仅受该列自身更新的影响，因此在当前处理阶段，对后续列的更新与该列的量化结果无关。由此，可以对两个更新项都采用延迟批量处理，以提高 GPU 利用率。具体而言，给定一个列块 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aQaQq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u61af911b" id="u61af911b">，首先利用切片后的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nVf4e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e0fc640" id="u4e0fc640"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70f59d200803e61aaf24c5e731ebd833.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zGDSM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u756fda80" id="u756fda80"> 更新块内各列，再通过下式更新块外的其余权重：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ued1d5eb0" id="ued1d5eb0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2CQ%3A%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%7D_%7B%3A%2CQ%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2CQ%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7BQQ%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BL%7D_%7BQ%2CQ%3A%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%3A%2CQ%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7BQ%2CQ%3A%7D.%5C%5Cqquad%20(18)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f70147a007f81b7afef5ae4cc872239.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C9rRH%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub8cfb3ef" id="ub8cfb3ef" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791730103752-05c848ef-4dc8-465c-bf16-7e4f92dab94a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud53647a6-75f7-44b5-b4f2-f510fad1637%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u6637575a-6916-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A532%2C%22height%22%3A476%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A129793%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A665%2C%22originHeight%22%3A595%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUT%3AFPWEIGHTW%2CCALIBRATIONINPUTX%2CFPINPUTX%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A562%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM1GPTAOQUANTIZATIONFORONELAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A485%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3A%E8%AE%A1B%E4%B8%AAW%3A%E8%AE%A1B%E4%B8%80-(%E8%AE%A1B%22%2C%22x%22%3A98%2C%22y%22%3A375%2C%22width%22%3A439%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W%3A.(%E8%AE%A1B%3AW%3A(%E8%AE%A1B%3A-B%3A(%E8%AE%A1B(%E8%AE%A1B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A471%2C%22width%22%3A450%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22H-XX%2CAXX%2B(X-XX%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A382%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%3DLNOERSECHOLESKYH%2BAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A365%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220I%3DI%2CI%E5%8D%811%2C...%2CI%2BB-1D0%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A348%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BJ-I%2B(W%3AI-QJ)LJ%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A342%2C%22width%22%3A301%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P-(AXXLOMUL%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A315%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%81W%3AJ%E4%B8%8AIJ%3A(I%E8%AE%A1B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A237%2C%22y%22%3A416%2C%22width%22%3A189%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q%E4%B8%80UMXNE%E4%B8%800MXB%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A224%2C%22width%22%3A255%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q%3A%E4%B8%80GUANTW%3A.%22%2C%22x%22%3A88%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A255%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORI%3D0.B.2B....D0%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A252%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANDBLOCKSIZEB%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A178%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TV%3A.(%2BB%E4%B8%8A%3A(%E8%AE%A1B).(%E8%AE%A1B%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A186%2C%22y%22%3A518%2C%22width%22%3A316%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A541%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A66%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%81%AD.%22%2C%22x%22%3A91%2C%22y%22%3A370%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%81W.%22%2C%22x%22%3A166%2C%22y%22%3A504%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.1%22%2C%22x%22%3A70%2C%22y%22%3A468%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u31a370fc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p>